{"seq":1,"slug":"why-computational-geometry","title":"为何计算几何：当几何遇上算法与规模","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/computational-geometry/foundations/why-computational-geometry","wordCount":1639,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"为何计算几何-当几何遇上算法与规模\">为何计算几何：当几何遇上算法与规模</h1><p>给你三个点，判断它们是不是共线，这是初中题；给你一千万个点，问其中相距最近的两个点是哪一对，这就不再是几何题，而是算法题。计算几何研究的正是这个转折点：几何对象一旦数量变大、精度变有限、查询变频繁，朴素的公式化解法就会在时间或正确性上崩掉，必须换用专门设计的算法与数据结构。这门学科在 1970 年代由 Michael Shamos 的博士论文奠基，Preparata 与 Shamos 1985 年的《Computational Geometry: An Introduction》把它系统化，此后 de Berg 等人的《Computational Geometry: Algorithms and Applications》成为教学标准。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>计算几何把「几何问题」重新表述为「输入是几何对象（点、线段、多边形）、输出也是几何对象或它们之间关系」的计算问题，然后用算法复杂度的尺子去衡量解法。它关心三个维度：时间复杂度（多快）、空间复杂度（多省）、以及数值鲁棒性（在浮点数下是否仍然正确）。最后一维是它区别于纯算法课的关键——排序算法不会因为浮点误差而输出错误的顺序，但几何算法会因为一次符号判断失误而构造出拓扑上不可能的结果。</p>\n<p>下图勾勒本 hub 四条主线如何从底层能力逐级支撑上层应用。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[几何图元与谓词&lt;br/&gt;点/向量/叉积/转向测试] --&gt; B[鲁棒性与退化&lt;br/&gt;精确算术/符号扰动]&#10;  A --&gt; C[凸包/三角剖分/Delaunay&lt;br/&gt;结构构造]&#10;  B --&gt; C&#10;  C --&gt; D[相交/范围搜索/点定位&lt;br/&gt;几何查询]&#10;  A --&gt; D&#10;  C --&gt; E[最近邻/碰撞/GIS&lt;br/&gt;工程应用]&#10;  D --&gt; E\">graph TD\n  A[几何图元与谓词&lt;br/&gt;点/向量/叉积/转向测试] --&gt; B[鲁棒性与退化&lt;br/&gt;精确算术/符号扰动]\n  A --&gt; C[凸包/三角剖分/Delaunay&lt;br/&gt;结构构造]\n  B --&gt; C\n  C --&gt; D[相交/范围搜索/点定位&lt;br/&gt;几何查询]\n  A --&gt; D\n  C --&gt; E[最近邻/碰撞/GIS&lt;br/&gt;工程应用]\n  D --&gt; E</pre><p>计算几何与相邻学科的分工可以用一张表厘清。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>学科</th>\n<th>关注对象</th>\n<th>与计算几何的关系</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>欧氏几何</td>\n<td>图形的定理与证明</td>\n<td>提供数学事实，计算几何负责高效算出这些量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>图论</td>\n<td>抽象点边关系</td>\n<td>平面图、最短路上有交集，但图论无坐标</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数值分析</td>\n<td>连续量的近似与误差</td>\n<td>提供浮点误差理论，支撑鲁棒性一章</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>计算机图形学</td>\n<td>图像的生成与渲染</td>\n<td>大量使用几何算法作为底层，但目标是视觉输出</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>机器学习</td>\n<td>从数据中学习模式</td>\n<td>最近邻、kd 树是共享工具，度量视角不同</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"输出敏感复杂度-这门学科独特的效率视角\">输出敏感复杂度：这门学科独特的效率视角</h2><p>计算几何最有辨识度的思想之一，是用「输出规模」而非只用「输入规模」来衡量效率。以平面凸包为例：输入是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 个点，但真正落在凸包上的顶点只有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>h</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span></span></span></span></span> 个，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>h</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span></span></span></span></span> 可能远小于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span>。朴素的 Graham 扫描需要 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n \\log n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>h</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span></span></span></span></span> 无关；而 Chan 算法能做到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>h</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n \\log h)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，当凸包很小时快得多。Timothy Chan 1996 年给出的这个结果被证明是最优的，其巧妙之处在于把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n\\log n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 的分组扫描与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mi>h</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(nh)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">nh</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 的礼品包裹法拼在一起（来源：T. Chan, &quot;Optimal output-sensitive convex hull algorithms in two and three dimensions&quot;, Discrete &amp; Computational Geometry, 1996）。这类「让运行时间随实际输出自适应」的追求贯穿整个 hub，凸包一节会详细展开，见 <a href=\"../convex-triangulation/convex-hull\">凸包算法</a>。</p>\n<p>为什么输入规模不够用？因为许多几何问题的输出可大可小：线段相交的交点数、Voronoi 图的边数，都随输入分布剧烈变化。用一个对最坏情况死板的界去描述算法，会掩盖它在常见输入上的真实表现。</p>\n<h2 id=\"从暴力到高效-一个贯穿全书的动机\">从暴力到高效：一个贯穿全书的动机</h2><p>考虑「平面上 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 个点，找最近的一对」。暴力做法枚举所有点对，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n^2)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>6</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n = 10^6</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">6</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 时，这是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>12</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10^{12}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">12</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 次比较，现代机器也要跑上分钟到小时级。而分治法能做到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n\\log n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，把量级从万亿降到两千万，实时可算。这个从平方到线性对数的飞跃，正是计算几何存在的理由——它不满足于「能算」，而追求「在可接受时间内算完」。最近邻与它背后的空间索引会在 <a href=\"../practice/nearest-neighbor\">最近邻与空间索引</a> 深入。</p>\n<p>同样的动机也体现在查询问题上。如果每次范围查询都遍历全部点，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span></span></span></span></span> 次查询就是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>q</mi><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(qn)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">q</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>；但若先花 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n\\log n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 建一棵 kd 树或范围树，之后每次查询只需 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msqrt><mi>n</mi></msqrt><mo>+</mo><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(\\sqrt n + k)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0503em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8003em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"padding-left:0.833em;\">n</span></span><span style=\"top:-2.7603em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:0.853em;height:1.08em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"1.08em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 1080\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M95,702\nc-2.7,0,-7.17,-2.7,-13.5,-8c-5.8,-5.3,-9.5,-10,-9.5,-14\nc0,-2,0.3,-3.3,1,-4c1.3,-2.7,23.83,-20.7,67.5,-54\nc44.2,-33.3,65.8,-50.3,66.5,-51c1.3,-1.3,3,-2,5,-2c4.7,0,8.7,3.3,12,10\ns173,378,173,378c0.7,0,35.3,-71,104,-213c68.7,-142,137.5,-285,206.5,-429\nc69,-144,104.5,-217.7,106.5,-221\nl0 -0\nc5.3,-9.3,12,-14,20,-14\nH400000v40H845.2724\ns-225.272,467,-225.272,467s-235,486,-235,486c-2.7,4.7,-9,7,-19,7\nc-6,0,-10,-1,-12,-3s-194,-422,-194,-422s-65,47,-65,47z\nM834 80h400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2397em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(\\log^2 n + k)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1484em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8984em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.1473em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。用一次预处理换来无数次廉价查询，是几何数据结构的核心交易，详见 <a href=\"../queries/range-search\">范围搜索与 kd 树</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"问题版图-这门学科都研究些什么\">问题版图：这门学科都研究些什么</h2><p>把计算几何的经典问题铺开，大致落在四个抽屉里，恰好对应本 hub 的四章。构造类：凸包、三角剖分、Voronoi/Delaunay；相交类：线段相交、多边形布尔运算、可见性；邻近类：最近邻、最近点对、最小包围圆；查询类：范围搜索、点定位、区间查询。这些问题彼此并非孤立——Delaunay 三角网的对偶就是 Voronoi 图，最近邻可以用 Voronoi 图或 kd 树解，点定位又常以三角剖分为底层结构。理解这张关系网，比孤立记住每个算法更重要。</p>\n<p>值得强调的是维度的影响。二维问题往往有优雅的最优解，一旦升到三维乃至高维，同一个问题的复杂度可能爆炸：平面凸包是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n\\log n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，而 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span> 维凸包的最坏面数是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>n</mi><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌊</mo><mi>d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌋</mo></mrow></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n^{\\lfloor d/2 \\rfloor})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.138em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.888em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mopen mtight\">⌊</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">/2</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">⌋</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。高维下的「维度诅咒」也让精确最近邻变得不切实际，从而催生了近似最近邻这一整支实践，见 <a href=\"../practice/nearest-neighbor\">最近邻与空间索引</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>计算几何研究的是几何问题在「规模大、精度有限、查询频繁」条件下的高效且正确的算法化解法，1970 年代由 Shamos 等人奠基。</li>\n<li>它用时间、空间、数值鲁棒性三把尺子衡量解法，其中鲁棒性是区别于纯算法课的独特维度。</li>\n<li>输出敏感复杂度（如凸包的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>h</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n\\log h)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>）是这门学科标志性的效率视角，让运行时间随实际输出自适应。</li>\n<li>经典问题分为构造、相交、邻近、查询四类，恰好对应本 hub 四章；它们通过 Delaunay-Voronoi 对偶等关系彼此关联，构成一张知识网。</li>\n<li>维度显著影响难度，高维催生了近似算法这一实践分支。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读-跨库链接\">延伸阅读 / 跨库链接</h2><ul>\n<li>下一步先掌握工具箱：<a href=\"geometric-primitives\">几何图元与谓词</a>。</li>\n<li>精度为什么是大问题：<a href=\"robustness-degeneracy\">鲁棒性与退化</a>。</li>\n<li>复杂度分析的通用基础：<a href=\"../../../cs-fundamentals/data-structures/fundamentals/complexity-analysis\">数据结构·复杂度分析</a>。</li>\n<li>面向刷题的速查版：<a href=\"../../../cs-fundamentals/algorithms/computational-geometry/geometry-basics\">算法·计算几何基础</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"为何计算几何：当几何遇上算法与规模","id":"为何计算几何-当几何遇上算法与规模"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"输出敏感复杂度：这门学科独特的效率视角","id":"输出敏感复杂度-这门学科独特的效率视角"},{"level":2,"text":"从暴力到高效：一个贯穿全书的动机","id":"从暴力到高效-一个贯穿全书的动机"},{"level":2,"text":"问题版图：这门学科都研究些什么","id":"问题版图-这门学科都研究些什么"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读 / 跨库链接","id":"延伸阅读-跨库链接"}],"prev":null,"next":{"title":"几何图元与谓词：叉积决定一切","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mathematics-statistics/computational-geometry/foundations/geometric-primitives"}}